 # 20\. User Stories

 ## User Story 1 — Create Comic

 > As a user, I want to enter a story idea so that ComicCraft can create a comic from it.

 **Acceptance criteria:**

 - User can enter an idea.
- User can select options.
- User can generate a comic.
- Generated content appears in the editor.

---

 ## User Story 2 — Edit Dialogue

 > As a creator, I want to edit AI-generated dialogue so that I can control the final story.

 **Acceptance criteria:**

 - Dialogue can be edited.
- Changes can be saved.
- Updated dialogue appears in preview.

---

 ## User Story 3 — Regenerate Panel

 > As a creator, I want to regenerate one panel without changing the rest of the comic.

 **Acceptance criteria:**

 - User can select a panel.
- User can provide an instruction.
- Gemini generates an alternative.
- Other panels remain unchanged.

---

 ## User Story 4 — Continue Story

 > As a creator, I want to continue my comic so that I can create additional pages.

 **Acceptance criteria:**

 - Existing story context is supplied to Gemini.
- New page(s) are generated.
- Existing pages remain unchanged.
- Page numbering remains correct.

