 # 22\. Requirement Priority

 A MoSCoW classification helps control the MVP.

 ### Must Have

 - User authentication
- Project creation
- Story input
- Gemini integration
- Story generation
- Character generation
- Page/panel generation
- Dialogue
- Comic editor
- Save/load
- Preview
- Basic export

 ### Should Have

 - Story Bible
- Panel regeneration
- Dialogue rewriting
- Continue Story
- Autosave
- Responsive editor

 ### Could Have

 - Multiple comic templates
- Advanced page layouts
- Character reference sheets
- Additional export formats

 ### Won't Have in MVP

 - Real-time collaboration
- Marketplace
- Animated comics
- Full mobile application
- Advanced publishing system

