 # 23\. Acceptance Criteria

 The MVP should satisfy these conditions:

```
✓ User can register/login
✓ User can create a comic project
✓ User can enter a story idea
✓ Gemini generates valid structured data
✓ Characters are generated
✓ Pages and panels are generated
✓ Dialogue is generated
✓ User can edit generated content
✓ User can regenerate a panel
✓ User can continue the story
✓ Project can be saved
✓ Saved project can be reopened
✓ Comic can be previewed
✓ Comic can be exported
✓ Unauthorized users cannot access private projects
✓ Gemini failures are handled gracefully
```

